Re: Oven Repair Request — Flat 3, 3 Willowmere Road, Alderwick, ZZ9 6ZZ (instructed 26 August 2025).

The tenant reports the visit took place on 8 September and that the main oven heating element was replaced and is working. To complete our file please send within 3 working days:
1. Your invoice (net, VAT and total) and the job sheet/engineer's notes;
2. Any photos taken on site;
3. Written confirmation of the trading name invoicing for this job and that it is the company we instructed under this work order — our record and your paperwork do not currently match.

Please do not re-attend. No payment will be released until the above is received and the landlord has approved the invoice.
